From 0863f8f7fdaf73766bd326882b678bae806c72b4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FunnyAWM <1142978300@qq.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 16:20:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(desktop): rebrand the app as KouriChat Next

Ship the new mark from assets/logo.svg across every icon surface
(Windows ICO, mac ICNS/Icon Composer, MSIX tiles, window/favicon and the
in-app BrandMark) and rename the visible product to KouriChat Next, with
Light/Agent/Headless suffixes per variant. appId, userData key, CLI
launcher and artifact names stay on "hermes" so existing installs,
updates and the agent runtime keep working.
